      "label": "qst650405_0190",
      "style": 82,
      "name": "They're despicable to the end."
    },
    {
      "$id": 20,
      "label": "qst650405_0200",
      "style": 82,
      "name": "Hmm... Would they really\ngo that far...?"
    },
    {
      "$id": 21,
      "label": "qst650405_0210",
      "style": 82,
      "name": "They see them as nothing but food. Whether\nthey're alive or dead, it makes no difference."
    },
    {
      "$id": 22,
      "label": "qst650405_0220",
      "style": 82,
      "name": "Then what do we do?"
    },
    {
      "$id": 23,
      "label": "qst650405_0230",
      "style": 82,
      "name": "Could we lure them away somehow?"
    },
    {
      "$id": 24,
      "label": "qst650405_0240",
      "style": 82,
      "name": "Their leader left underlings behind when he moved on.\nI doubt he'll come out that easily."
    },
    {
      "$id": 25,
      "label": "qst650405_0250",
      "style": 82,
      "name": "Yeah."
    },
    {
      "$id": 26,
      "label": "qst650405_0260",
      "style": 82,
      "name": "Hikari, could you take that one?"
